    "issues": {
        "ipv6_disabled": {
            "description": "Matter, baz\u0131 cihazlarla ileti\u015fim kurmak i\u00e7in IPv6\u2019ya ihtiya\u00e7 duyar; ancak ba\u011fl\u0131 t\u00fcm a\u011f aray\u00fczlerinizde IPv6 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131d\u0131r. Yerel olarak ba\u011flanm\u0131\u015f Wi-Fi ve Ethernet cihazlar\u0131 h\u00e2l\u00e2 \u00e7al\u0131\u015fabilir, ancak harici bir Thread s\u0131n\u0131r y\u00f6nlendiricisi kullanmak gibi \u00f6zellikler i\u00e7in IPv6\u2019n\u0131n etkinle\u015ftirilmesi gerekir. A\u011f ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7mak i\u00e7in \u201cDaha fazla bilgi\u201d se\u00e7ene\u011fini se\u00e7in.",
            "title": "IPv6 devre d\u0131\u015f\u0131 b\u0131rak\u0131lm\u0131\u015f ancak Matter taraf\u0131ndan zorunlu tutulmaktad\u0131r"
        },
        "server_version_version_too_new": {
            "description": "\u015eu anda \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131z Matter Server s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc, Home Assistant'\u0131n bu s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc i\u00e7in \u00e7ok yeni. Bu sorunu d\u00fczeltmek i\u00e7in l\u00fctfen Home Assistant'\u0131 g\u00fcncelleyin veya Matter Server'\u0131n s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc eski bir s\u00fcr\u00fcme d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcr\u00fcn.",
            "title": "Matter Server'\u0131n eski s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc gerekli"
